  "title": "White Album 2nd Season",
  "title_english": "White Album Season 2",
  "title_japanese": "WHITE ALBUM 第2期",
  "title_synonyms": [
    "White Album Second Season",
    "White Album the Latter Half"
  ],
  "type": "legendado",
  "source": "Visual novel",
  "episodes": [
    {
      "numero": 1,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzCO7iF_UJT20UfeuWK1SdGQdqpZ7ncca0_7qpU_9zmzIXDEQSlkAZO93PTcxQ-5KCddn0hKkegIBpbWZb_mnWAsBCGQflBpfOouQxXkZF6MFm64KKblOxLaOzr_dcFgohSlguL",
      "nome": "There was never an instance where the tuning matched. I have come to think that there exists a better spot out there."
    },
    {
      "numero": 2,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dy_Bz_u_UYL89VGmhhRfdDtrDMKm28_VpX8_lvS09dsN8y358ZM34TPN9pgms2SLXIW7UnwqNOsu3rB5MRo_bdR1T6QUZUdPoqbL2aP1SW_8gyxhGlMn8FGqbK594b7WFp3WTw",
      "nome": "The things hidden from view are destroying everything around it. Since it was never there, nothing can be done to deal with it."
    },
    {
      "numero": 3,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dyowSJqdgzw5kybGlJpyEhwPkVsBxTlYog8JxGKPPXwakeAB05bHV7XMLV7mom4AUDQ6nSQSJYSm3xq42_NZHoeaPE-_OcIHUm19XLUmi1GI7g0tQ6y-X_CBi1xc4mbmYE74jHL",
      "nome": "I do writhe in embarrassment when I reminisce my childhood. Moreover so if I make comparisons."
    },
    {
      "numero": 4,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzq15PypXmMBYXLHJP1VSU1LOMbTYUMW5Txw-P0et81Pzz1kGf3sX3um40CrqYJ_QBs6NXAdld0pyuEzUTLbEjlb40IGbNbGF1X0kj6QZQhEjoSN-P0ydvEQnNgBDZfHhszokY",
      "nome": "I have lies that I want to expose. I have truths that I do not wish to believe. I have one of these each."
    },
    {
      "numero": 5,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dxWu7odZwc2vuCotDjTVYWJnvbzP9OBqaL_m5Zgn-ZNz_v9Lq_UbUXg_cPY2EwiXVtIvHX1ElGxNqx-1sv7fvAcFEoLBDH_iCAHL1aJs7QsXqRaa70gkg7MeCAilmWcNC9Mgc7v",
      "nome": "Aren't you taking too much for granted? Complaining that you are claustrophobic while you are hiding in your own shell."
    },
    {
      "numero": 6,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dyd2mUdsxwpX6ZN3t5ZyR0WEfOWW2yKNQFyQK-33w5WLLTh8QECNdt8ga3iPFJRIQNp9e0eDRE1A0RWLVasvFeuLFpjGCVctgUTNeIlRVS7zLxcHe0ieNMh-tCxuU6ZAd8bmws",
      "nome": "I move on as I am losing interest. Most of the time though, I seem to have already lost interest before I move on."
    },
    {
      "numero": 7,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dxSZB3cjtY2Zh8LJLIjYaeug_4_Wc-D3ZM367zCKcr125wWsS05MS_SKSkrausWACMfFP0b_iEkzIMh1F8PEC9H5VUK7FgYJ3IFdLV4emN_0KVd2qWV2bZC-bLyLeDF50Qj3CWT",
      "nome": "Love is beyond reason. Lovers who say this to one another are poets, critics, philosophers."
    },
    {
      "numero": 8,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dywYgy5yUOic3muhPupCIi3Px49xCF3818Cen-6ZMkPDel5wJUBVemg9NroqZx5bry1rNnoNFV3nEvknZxBjgjTbgpeeoBicwftF4nRLiZVCGAfX2Aiwd5rmg6M0sIXLiCnBas",
      "nome": "I think I want to return to the crossroad. Would have been better if I had chosen the right one. That journey filled only with regret."
    },
    {
      "numero": 9,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzxBAPASsOLwKSomnDBTR0Pi71CGtTkGQF1PzgBe_-GUvG3eXLVBmMvBl2mEqS2xMgB-pTzbAZb7yS8TW_s_PXTVPRmtmny7EkqCo5nnjrbACf4QZanszGXkgfIMLIocqnx_DL1",
      "nome": "Having troubles expressing yourself? Try to strike a conversation with your eyes and you'll soon find yourself in the mood for a chat."
    },
    {
      "numero": 10,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dztYakbbYEC3crGZvqZx_cUE-ePYSrgBIcQzth5YCvyNISIDNiNXXgb66qEjLALoQ60Ps6ngFvQ8UcI4ot5pFCUuKX1j3xxhEEIH3DrzmKFGNHFSTU6Gs5nAQfn5hMlqt7sv4c",
      "nome": "I have come to desire catching a cold in anticipation of the nursing and the home-cooked dishes. I didn't include the later part suffering in my imagination at all."
    },
    {
      "numero": 11,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzn1L4EqqltBwJPobC0VzVBXL4QIv2MUXppPGg7gkw1i0SUWLYw0Figy1t7kLDGfL7t63ASdC-tIwvMG6BPjTwMSF_xstUXmloccNLYik6ciQZgXNlyUYSMnF_If3-7OWPWOsNX",
      "nome": "Nightfall did not bring about anything at all. It was the fault of the sun that the colors faded."
    },
    {
      "numero": 12,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzdN3wAchXkcAGanPmE90hKLqOiA3r8NWcOSnVGa6vO_upc6qE3bREpUJmahuE-hZkEcJPMIPciaSuRVwxMy0_lbVmI6pOhdjwXjYmCixnbUcsbsJnfcrkfoA1CPDkIdkIlJiRV",
      "nome": "It's the fault of others. I'm not at fault. All the fault lies in others. Only I myself am―"
    },
    {
      "numero": 13,
      "url": "https://www.blogger.com/video.g?token=AD6v5dzleRlxXJFjK18a02Qcbho1KXydYeRbFQ060LwBDy83QGaQcNoz-h6U_8vr0VPO5_2oj8jU0CLvdA02kyO78hkYUFpwPFNVfe2xwRPL0AgTuuqGUZqX4M7topmardknvVCjOpA",
      "nome": "We sit together now, and all night long we have not stirred."
    }
  ],
